    "title": "Kansas City Chiefs WR Rashee Rice files for bankruptcy facing $3M in debt - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Amelia Jones ,\n9 hours ago\nKansas City Chiefs receiver Rashee Rice has filed for Chapter 7 bankruptcy, reporting over $3 million in debt largely tied to his 2024 Dallas car crash. The bankruptcy filing automatically pauses ongoing civil lawsuits and active wage garnishments from victims of the multi-car pileup. It remains unclear whether Rice will...\nRead full article\nAdd to Preferred Sources",
